TextDelta " the"
TextDelta " `sleep 120` command"
TextDelta ".\\n\\nThe agent never"
TextDelta " actually ran the sleep"
TextDelta " command—"
TextDelta "it was stopped"
TextDelta " as"
TextDelta " soon as it was spaw"
TextDelta "ned."
